---
// src/components/bangalore/CommonQuestions.astro
---
<section class="py-24 bg-white w-full border-t border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Common questions
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      
      <!-- FAQ -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-md p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-xl">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3">What do you need from me?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-800 font-bold leading-relaxed mb-2">
          One month of payment reports, your order data, and the bank statement for that account.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-800 font-bold leading-relaxed">
          We will show you where to download each one.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-md p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-xl">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3">Will you raise the claim for me?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-800 font-bold leading-relaxed mb-2">
          <span class="font-black bg-amber-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded mr-1 border border-slate-300">Yes.</span> We raise it with the order number and follow it up.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-800 font-bold leading-relaxed">
          These companies do reverse charges when there is no record that you agreed. Somebody just has to ask.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-md p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-xl">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3">What if you find nothing?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-800 font-bold leading-relaxed">
          Then we tell you your payments are clean. That is also worth knowing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-md p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-xl">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3">Is my data safe?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-800 font-bold leading-relaxed">
          <span class="font-black bg-amber-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded mr-1 border border-slate-300">Yes.</span> Used only for your check, shared with nobody.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Final CTA snippet -->
    <div class="mt-16 text-center bg-blue-600 rounded-md p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 shadow-xl">
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-4">
          One month. One check. Free.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-blue-100 font-bold mb-8">
          Free for the next 20 restaurants in Bangalore.
        </p>
        <a href="#free-check" class="inline-flex justify-center items-center px-8 py-4 text-lg font-black rounded text-slate-900 bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#1DA851] transition-transform shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1">
          Get my free check
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
